  Practical subjects for Programming (M1 AI), and the starter code shipped
  with them: CMake skeletons, header and function stubs, the calculator and
  pybind11 projects, and the TSP instance generator.
  Referenced by: Master/M1/S7/Programming/
  The subjects themselves are not redistributed: each practical keeps its PDF
  and its .txt extraction in a handout/ directory that .gitignore excludes.
